flowchart TD
    Canonical[Canonical Space URL<br/>myspace.metadyn.xyz]
    Settings[Dashboard Domain Settings UI]
    Custom[Requested Custom Domain<br/>world.clientbrand.com]
    DNSInstr[Dashboard shows DNS instructions<br/>usually CNAME to canonical space]
    CustDNS[Customer DNS Provider]
    Verify[MetaDyn verifies ownership / routing]
    HostAPI[Host Deployment API]
    Nginx[Nginx host config update]
    Live[Custom domain live]
    Auth{MetaDyn session available?}
    Login[Redirect to dashboard login]
    Return[Return to custom domain]
    Enter[Enter space]
    Fallback[Canonical MetaDyn URL remains fallback]

    Canonical --> Settings
    Settings --> Custom
    Custom --> DNSInstr
    DNSInstr --> CustDNS
    CustDNS --> Verify
    Verify --> HostAPI
    HostAPI --> Nginx
    Nginx --> Live
    Canonical --> Fallback

    Live --> Auth
    Auth -->|No| Login
    Login --> Return
    Return --> Enter
    Auth -->|Yes| Enter
